# Relationships between works: Louisa May Alcott's Little Women (1868-69) and four adaptations:
# graphic novel, play, opera and film. The novel came out in two parts (1868, 1869), each a work of
# its own and a part of the novel; the second is the sequel to the first. Each adaptation is a new
# work, related to the novel at work level, or at expression level where RDA and the profile have
# the relationship only there (the opera).
